    {
      "id": "california",
      "title": "California Lullabye",
      "artist": "Josh Woodward",
      "mood": "暖一点的吉他人声",
      "description": "带一点夏天与回忆的感觉。",
      "src": "./media/california-lullabye.mp3",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.joshwoodward.com/song/CaliforniaLullabye",
      "instrumental": false,
      "lyrics": [
        {
          "time": 21.64,
          "end": 27.1,
          "text": "The skies are cold and gray"
        },
        {
          "time": 26.5,
          "end": 32.7,
          "text": "The storm is on its way"
        },
        {
          "time": 32.1,
          "end": 40.54,
          "text": "The flat horizon, leafless trees, there's nothing far as you can see, out here"
        },
        {
          "time": 43.9,
          "end": 48.54,
          "text": "You shiver like a waif"
        },
        {
          "time": 48.94,
          "end": 54.92,
          "text": "Your snow boot soles are chafed"
        },
        {
          "time": 54.32,
          "end": 62.72,
          "text": "You left your heart in paradise, you left it all to roll the dice with me"
        },
        {
          "time": 63.92,
          "end": 70.5,
          "text": "And I will shake away the cloudy skies"
        },
        {
          "time": 69.9,
          "end": 75.52,
          "text": "With a California lullabye"
        },
        {
          "time": 74.92,
          "end": 78.44,
          "text": "And when you're frozen with desire"
        },
        {
          "time": 78.32,
          "end": 81.24,
          "text": "We'll put our toes up to the fire"
        },
        {
          "time": 80.64,
          "end": 84.12,
          "text": "And I will sing your cares away"
        },
        {
          "time": 88.58,
          "end": 92.8,
          "text": "The sand between my toes"
        },
        {
          "time": 93.48,
          "end": 98.56,
          "text": "Your hands beneath my clothes"
        },
        {
          "time": 99.2,
          "end": 106.3,
          "text": "The memories of golden days, where first we met, and parted ways so soon"
        },
        {
          "time": 110.62,
          "end": 113.96,
          "text": "But distance lost its fight"
        },
        {
          "time": 113.86,
          "end": 119.9,
          "text": "When you laid down at night"
        },
        {
          "time": 120.64,
          "end": 129.06,
          "text": "Without a map, you chose your heart, now we are one, but you're still far from home"
        },
        {
          "time": 128.46,
          "end": 135.98,
          "text": "So let me shake away the cloudy skies"
        },
        {
          "time": 135.38,
          "end": 141.06,
          "text": "With a California lullabye"
        },
        {
          "time": 140.46,
          "end": 143.94,
          "text": "And when you're frozen with desire"
        },
        {
          "time": 143.34,
          "end": 146.72,
          "text": "We'll put our toes up to the fire"
        },
        {
          "time": 146.12,
          "end": 149.44,
          "text": "And I will sing your cares away"
        },
        {
          "time": 148.84,
          "end": 154.82,
          "text": "And when you're frozen with desire"
        },
        {
          "time": 154.22,
          "end": 157.86,
          "text": "We'll put our toes up to the fire"
        },
        {
          "time": 157.26,
          "end": 160.88,
          "text": "And I will sing your cares away"
        },
        {
          "time": 164.2,
          "end": 172.32,
          "text": "I know it feels, like spinning wheels aredigging you much deeper in the snow"
        },
        {
          "time": 177.08,
          "end": 181.68,
          "text": "Don't worry, ‘cause the winter thaws, and you will watch the river start to flow"
        },
        {
          "time": 185.7,
          "end": 192.3,
          "text": "And in that place, the empty space, will fill you in a warm embrace"
        },
        {
          "time": 191.7,
          "end": 195.44,
          "text": "And I will hold you tight until it's home"
        },
        {
          "time": 195.7,
          "end": 201.24,
          "text": "I will shake away the cloudy skies"
        },
        {
          "time": 201.58,
          "end": 203.02,
          "text": "With a California lullabye"
        },
        {
          "time": 206.41,
